  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, a maestro has learned to approach music from both an intellectual standpoint and an emotional standpoint. If a maestro's Intelligence modifier is greater than his Charisma modifier, he adds his Intelligence modifier to his ranks in the Perform skill to calculate his skill modifier. If done, this replaces the addition of his Charisma modifier to calculate his Perform skill modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/maestro#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
